rgba(35,36,31,.12)\">04<\/span>\r\n        <span data-jicon=\"\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EFF1E7,#E3E7D8);color:#4A5438;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 14px 24px -14px rgba(35,36,31,.55);transition:background .5s,color .5s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-teeth\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n        <h3 style=\"position:relative;font:400 clamp(21px,2vw,25px)\/1.2 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;margin-bottom:12px\">Begin Treatment<\/h3>\r\n        <p style=\"position:relative;font:400 14.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54\">Treatment starts according to the agreed plan, with everything explained beforehand.<\/p>\r\n        <\/article>\r\n        <article data-jcard=\"\" data-tilt=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"position:relative;background:linear-gradient(165deg,#FFFDF7,#F5F2E8);border:1px solid #EDE9DC;border-radius:22px;padding:34px 28px 30px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 26px 50px -30px rgba(35,36,31,.5);transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .5s,border-color .5s\">\r\n        <span data-jbead=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:-9px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#FAF8F2;border:1px solid #DCC79B;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #FAF8F2,0 8px 14px -8px rgba(35,36,31,.5);transition:background .5s,box-shadow .5s\"><\/span>\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;right:22px;top:14px;font:400 clamp(52px,5vw,74px)\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#EDE9DC;text-shadow:0 1px 0 #FFF,0 3px 6px rgba(35,36,31,.12)\">05<\/span>\r\n        <span data-jicon=\"\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EFF1E7,#E3E7D8);color:#4A5438;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 14px 24px -14px rgba(35,36,31,.55);transition:background .5s,color .5s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-line\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n        <h3 style=\"position:relative;font:400 clamp(21px,2vw,25px)\/1.2 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;margin-bottom:12px\">Progress &amp; Adjustments<\/h3>\r\n        <p style=\"position:relative;font:400 14.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54\">Regular appointments let the clinical team monitor progress and fine tune the result.<\/p>\r\n        <\/article>\r\n        <article data-jcard=\"\" data-tilt=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"position:relative;background:linear-gradient(165deg,#FFFDF7,#F5F2E8);border:1px solid #EDE9DC;border-radius:22px;padding:34px 28px 30px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 26px 50px -30px rgba(35,36,31,.5);transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .5s,border-color .5s\">\r\n        <span data-jbead=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:-9px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#FAF8F2;border:1px solid #DCC79B;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #FAF8F2,0 8px 14px -8px rgba(35,36,31,.5);transition:background .5s,box-shadow .5s\"><\/span>\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;right:22px;top:14px;font:400 clamp(52px,5vw,74px)\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#EDE9DC;text-shadow:0 1px 0 #FFF,0 3px 6px rgba(35,36,31,.12)\">06<\/span>\r\n        <span data-jicon=\"\" style=\"position:relative;display:flex;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EFF1E7,#E3E7D8);color:#4A5438;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 14px 24px -14px rgba(35,36,31,.55);transition:background .5s,color .5s\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-heart\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n        <h3 style=\"position:relative;font:400 clamp(21px,2vw,25px)\/1.2 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;margin-bottom:12px\">Follow Up &amp; Aftercare<\/h3>\r\n        <p style=\"position:relative;font:400 14.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54\">Retention and ongoing guidance protect the result once active treatment ends.<\/p>\r\n        <\/article>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->\r\n        <section style=\"padding:0 0 clamp(60px,8vw,110px)\">\r\n        <div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n        \r\n        <div data-sechead=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto clamp(34px,4vw,48px)\">\r\n        <p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:500 11px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B2934F;margin-bottom:18px\">Good to know<\/p>\r\n        <h2 data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 clamp(30px,4vw,50px)\/1.12 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#4A5438\">Questions Before You Begin?<\/h2>\r\n        <span data-rule=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:#C2A469;margin:22px auto\"><\/span>\r\n        <p data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"font:400 16.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;max-width:56ch\">The questions we are asked most often, answered simply.<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        \r\n        <div data-techwrap=\"\" data-reveal=\"\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(30px,4vw,64px);align-items:center\">\r\n        <!-- Medallion. The tilt is neutralised from header.html section 5.6 so this\r\n             reads as a true circle and stays centred on every screen size. -->\r\n        <div data-reveal-child=\"\" data-medallion=\"\" style=\"flex:0 1 360px;min-width:260px;position:relative;padding:20px\">\r\n        <div data-medinner=\"\" style=\"position:relative;width:100%;padding-bottom:100%;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\">\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:8%;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#5A6645,#39422C);box-shadow:0 40px 70px -34px rgba(35,36,31,.75),0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.22) inset,0 -18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.5) inset\"><\/span>\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:14%;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(217,199,155,.45)\"><\/span>\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:2%;border-radius:50%;border:1px dashed rgba(194,164,105,.55);animation:bbSpin 34s linear infinite\"><\/span>\r\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:22%;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 26%,rgba(250,248,242,.28),rgba(250,248,242,0) 62%)\"><\/span>\r\n        <img alt=\"Braces and Beyond\" src=\"https:\/\/thebracesandbeyond.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/bbxbsrbu3ffu.webp\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:32%;filter:drop-shadow(0 18px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.55))\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"548\" height=\"660\">\r\n        <span data-medpill=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-6%;top:16%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#FFFDF7;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 22px 40px -22px rgba(35,36,31,.6);animation:bbFloat 8s ease-in-out infinite\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-clock\" style=\"color:#B2934F;font-size:12px\"><\/i>How long?<\/span>\r\n        <span data-medpill=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;right:-8%;top:47%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#FFFDF7;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 22px 40px -22px rgba(35,36,31,.6);animation:bbFloat2 9.5s ease-in-out infinite\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-face-smile\" style=\"color:#B2934F;font-size:12px\"><\/i>Does it hurt?<\/span>\r\n        <span data-medpill=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;left:2%;bottom:6%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#FFFDF7;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;font:400 13.5px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 22px 40px -22px rgba(35,36,31,.6);animation:bbFloat 10.5s ease-in-out infinite\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wallet\" style=\"color:#B2934F;font-size:12px\"><\/i>What will it cost?<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 460px;min-width:280px\">\r\n        <div data-acc=\"\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #E6E3D8\">\r\n        <div data-accitem=\"\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E6E3D8;border-radius:12px;transition:background .3s\">\r\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" data-accbtn=\"\" style=\"width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 16px;font:400 clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)\/1.35 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438\" type=\"button\">When should a child be seen?<span data-accicon=\"\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font:400 22px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#B2934F;transition:transform .3s\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n        <div data-accpanel=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\"><p style=\"font:400 15.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;padding:0 16px 24px;max-width:66ch\">An orthodontic assessment can help identify developing concerns involving tooth eruption, bite or jaw growth. The right timing depends on the individual child, and an assessment does not always mean treatment must begin straight away.<\/p><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div data-accitem=\"\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E6E3D8;border-radius:12px;transition:background .3s\">\r\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" data-accbtn=\"\" style=\"width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 16px;font:400 clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)\/1.35 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438\" type=\"button\">Can adults get braces?<span data-accicon=\"\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font:400 22px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#B2934F;transition:transform .3s\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n        <div data-accpanel=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\"><p style=\"font:400 15.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;padding:0 16px 24px;max-width:66ch\">Yes. Adults may be suitable for orthodontic treatment provided the teeth and supporting tissues are healthy. Options depend on the clinical findings and the goals of the patient.<\/p><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div data-accitem=\"\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E6E3D8;border-radius:12px;transition:background .3s\">\r\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" data-accbtn=\"\" style=\"width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 16px;font:400 clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)\/1.35 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438\" type=\"button\">How long does treatment take?<span data-accicon=\"\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font:400 22px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#B2934F;transition:transform .3s\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n        <div data-accpanel=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\"><p style=\"font:400 15.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;padding:0 16px 24px;max-width:66ch\">Duration varies with the complexity of the case, the type of appliance, growth and patient cooperation. A personalized estimate is provided after assessment and planning.<\/p><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div data-accitem=\"\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E6E3D8;border-radius:12px;transition:background .3s\">\r\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" data-accbtn=\"\" style=\"width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 16px;font:400 clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)\/1.35 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438\" type=\"button\">Is everyone suitable for clear aligners?<span data-accicon=\"\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font:400 22px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#B2934F;transition:transform .3s\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n        <div data-accpanel=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\"><p style=\"font:400 15.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;padding:0 16px 24px;max-width:66ch\">No. Clear aligners can be very effective for selected cases, but braces or another approach may be more appropriate for certain alignment and bite concerns.<\/p><\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div data-accitem=\"\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E6E3D8;border-radius:12px;transition:background .3s\">\r\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" data-accbtn=\"\" style=\"width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 16px;font:400 clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)\/1.35 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4A5438\" type=\"button\">Will I need retainers?<span data-accicon=\"\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font:400 22px\/1 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#B2934F;transition:transform .3s\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n        <div data-accpanel=\"\" style=\"overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\"><p style=\"font:400 15.5px\/1.75 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5C5E54;padding:0 16px 24px;max-width:66ch\">Most orthodontic patients require retention after active tr